{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415707","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415707","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041570701:0":{"text":"没想到会在这里见到先祖，真是奇妙的缘分啊！","source_cn":"没想到会在这里见到先祖，真是奇妙的缘分啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166FEB8839655BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570702:0":{"text":"要是我没记错的话，你是缇……哦，想起来了，缇洛亚贤者，对吧？","source_cn":"要是我没记错的话，你是缇……哦，想起来了，缇洛亚贤者，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D40FE553A9F0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570703:0":{"text":"等等！我……？先祖？！你、你认错人了吧！","source_cn":"等等！我……？先祖？！你、你认错人了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214D5326C7F2A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570704:0":{"text":"不不不，我还没到老眼昏花的年纪，不会认错人！","source_cn":"不不不，我还没到老眼昏花的年纪，不会认错人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204AF365F934873B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570705:0":{"text":"虽然你看上去比记史卷轴绘制的模样年轻不少，但我一眼就能认出你——尤其是你这双漂亮的鹿角。","source_cn":"虽然你看上去比记史卷轴绘制的模样年轻不少，但我一眼就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x774845992AB16F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570706:0":{"text":"哇哦……真是出乎意料的情况……","source_cn":"哇哦……真是出乎意料的情况……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BDF8E6BE8FE340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570707:0":{"text":"总之……呃，谢谢你的夸奖？你的鹿角保养得也很不错。","source_cn":"总之……呃，谢谢你的夸奖？你的鹿角保养得也很不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF048FB71EA0B6EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570708:0":{"text":"呵呵，这都是多亏了达米安那小子。","source_cn":"呵呵，这都是多亏了达米安那小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x950AA7E3EFE34845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570709:0":{"text":"他研制了好几种鹿角滋养液，大部分的功效都还算说得过去。","source_cn":"他研制了好几种鹿角滋养液，大部分的功效都还算说得过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0F6115D62A9533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570710:0":{"text":"我记得，其中有一种滋养液会散发奇特的香味，能够驱赶被鹿角上的新芽吸引过来的虫蝇……","source_cn":"我记得，其中有一种滋养液会散发奇特的香味，能够驱赶被鹿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464C5DFCB6E3C923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570711:0":{"text":"听起来不错，分我点。","source_cn":"听起来不错，分我点。"